  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to peaceful coexistence in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project focuses on grassroots peacebuilding addressing intercommunal violence in hotspots in Ethiopia. An important aim of the project is to build on religious actors (women, men, and youth) and local human resources (women, men and youth) in the conflict contexts to enable and support them in promoting social cohesion and reconciliation in their own conflict contexts. The overall goal is that community members in conflict affected areas in Ethiopia enjoy peaceful coexistence and intercommunal collaboration.</narrative>
  </description>
